{title: Worthy of it All}
{artist: David Brymer}
{key: D}

{comment: Verse 1}
[D]All the saints and [E/D]angels, [D]bow before Your [E/D]throne '
[D]All the elders [E/D]cast their crowns before the [D]Lamb of [E/D]God and [A]sing

{comment: Chorus}
You are worthy of it [A]all - You are worthy of it [E]all
From You are all [D]things - and to you are all [E]things
You deserve the [A]glory

{comment: Bridge}
[A]Day and night, night and day let [C#m]incense arise
[F#m]Day and night, night and day let [D6]incense arise
[A/E]Day and night, night and day let [E]incense arise
[Bm]Day and night, night and day let [D]incense arise
